                    1970–73, SOC 11–5. Administratively Confidential. Copies were sent to Ehrlichman and Cole.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d160-f2" n="2" xml:id="d160-f2-content">
                <p>
                    Rogers replied to Ash on February 13 that he would consider the
                    proposal. (Ibid.)</p>
            </note>
